[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692023081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103417#issuecomment-2692023081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103417","id":2692023081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gdQMp","user":{"login":"amarsero","id":18059974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDU5OTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18059974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero","html_url":"https://github.com/amarsero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T06:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T06:58:14Z","body":"I'll look into it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692023081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692353755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103417#issuecomment-2692353755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103417","id":2692353755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6geg7b","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T18:22:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T18:22:06Z","body":"Did you find the issue @amarsero ? Just for my curiosity, I was investigating this issue. I'm not 100% certain why the modifications from #102636 afftected this issue but I think the issue is caused because with the modifications, the Player script in the MVP is now valid at the moment of the upgrade, causing the autoload script (BulletManager) to load while loading the Player script during the upgrade process.\n\nIn the `GDScriptCache::get_shallow_script`, the BulletManager script resource (which is an embedded script into the scene) is created but without it's scene unique id.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e644477-2142-491b-9a26-3a4a9fe8cd86)\n\nThat causes the save of the bullet_manager.tscn to create a new embedded script with a new id when resaving it in the upgrade process.\n\nI fixed the issue on my side by using the `ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_REPLACE` cache mode to the `ResourceLoader::load` in `UIDUpgradeTool::finish_upgrade`:\n```cpp\nRef<Resource> res = ResourceLoader::load(file_path, \"\", ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_REPLACE);\n```\n\nThat forces the scene and the script to be reloaded completely from the disk during the upgrade progress.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692353755/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692356294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103417#issuecomment-2692356294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103417","id":2692356294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gehjG","user":{"login":"amarsero","id":18059974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDU5OTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18059974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero","html_url":"https://github.com/amarsero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T18:29:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T18:29:12Z","body":"@Hilderin I didn't investigate that far but looks like you've got it.\n\nIf you want to open a PR please do so!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692356294/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]